{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>將您的 iPhone 轉變為強大的人工智能文檔掃描器與文字提取工具。無論是數字化收據、掃描合同還是從照片中提取文字，此應用都能在幾秒內完成任務。現在限時免費下載，助您輕鬆管理日常文件。</p>\n\n<h2>智能掃描與多語言翻譯</h2>\n<p>內建掃描器支援多頁捕捉、透視校正及色彩濾鏡，一鍵輸出精美 PDF。相機可即時識別印刷品、手寫筆記及書籍文字，並支援包括中文在內的九種語言離線翻譯。頁面編輯器允許調整亮度對比度、精確裁剪及使用清理筆去除瑕疵。所有文件透過 iCloud 自動同步於各 Apple 裝置間，確保數據隨時更新且安全無虞。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-122-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Text Scanner AI: OCR &amp; Scan</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T09:18:14.723720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}